 //
 // Bit SetToMaxPos: Indicates that the input value plus the bias plus the CI would be too large for a biased exponent representation.  These input conditions are an input of MaxPos and a CI of 1.
 //
 // Bit SetTo0: Indicates that the input value plus the bias plus the CI would be too small (too close to zero) for a biased exponent representation.  These input conditions are an input of MaxNeg and a CI of 0.
