 Object Text;  //_GUI 292,241,If the two counts are equal it can mean two things:1. When Fetch and Retire are synchronized and if a retire occurs without a simultaneous fetch, then the retire has passed the fetch and this is an error.2. Retire has caught up to an errored fetch and there is an existing fetch error.  A retire will produce a retire error.
