    , Variant AlmFull, Variant AlmEmpty, Variant Empty, Variant Done
    , Variant Busy) FIFO( Variant DataIn, Variant Size, Variant AlmBits
    , Bit ClkWr, Bit ClkRd, Bit Reset, Variant Go
