Object ( Variant O) TBusJunction( Variant I1, Variant I2) 
//_ Attributes TreeGroup="CoreLib\\Multiplexers\\Async\\Advanced\\TBuf"
{
 // An object for linking together two tri-state busses to become the same tri-state bus.
 //
 // Inputs:
 //
 // TBus input: This is a tri-state bus input.  It can only be connected to a TBusJunction object's output or a TBuf object's output.
 //
 // TBus input: This is another tri-state bus input.  It can only be connected to a TBusJunction object's output or a TBuf object's output.  The width of both TBus inputs must be the same or a compile time trap will be raised.  The dataset of the output's TBus's internal Data dataset is that of the top input's TBus.  If both of the TBus inputs are being enabled simultaneously, a runtime trap is generated while simulating.
 //
 // Outputs:
 //
 // TBus output: This is a tri-state bus output.  It can only be connected to a TBusJunction object's inputs or a TBusData object's input. The dataset of the output's TBus's internal Data dataset is that of the top input's TBus
 //
