 //
 // Var/List Abs: Absolute value of Val
 //
 // Bit ClkG: Clock input pass through
 //
 // Bit AClr: Clear input pass through
 //
 // Bit Done: Done of GDBW
 //
 // Bit Busy: Busy of GDBW
 //
