 Object Text;  //_GUI 83,5,We could use the sign bit handling in the SRT divider, but that would require handling on the tail end to get the sign on the remainder correct. In the unsigned version the sign bit is set to a constant, thus removing some of the objects. With that in mind we might as well just do the twos conversion on the front and back end for simplicity's sake -- it doesn't use any more hardware.
