    , Variant PipeLen, Bit ClkG, Bit AClr, Bit Done
    , Bit Busy) UDivMod_Pipe_Fast( Variant N, Variant D, Bit ClkG
    , Bit AClr, Bit Go, Bit Wait) ;  //_GUI 115,54
 Object Text;  //_GUI 142,92,UDivMod outputs MaxInt on OFL.  We need to remove the top bit and use it to generate our overflow.  Replace the bit with a zero bit so we get MaxInt_Twos on an error.
